=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Kuroido-Moido} to begin this quest. Rezone if you just completed the previous quest.
* Head to {z:Garlaige Citadel}.
* Once inside kill {m:Fallen Evacuees|Fallen Evacuee} in the small rooms near(ish) the entrance until you get a {i:Garlaige Key|Garlaige Key|502}.
* Head past the first two **Banishing Gate**s and use the {i:Garlaige Key|Garlaige Key|502} to get into the Incinerator room at (I-7) on the third map.
** Obtain a {k:Pouch of weighted stones} from the ??? on the ground on map 1 (G-8). This allows you to pass through the gates alone.
** Proceed through the Banishing Gate #1 at (I-9) on the first map.
** Then proceed through the Banishing Gate #2 at (H-10) on the second map.
* Speak to {n:Mashira} in the Incinerator Room at (I-7) who will hand you a {k:Broken wand}.
* Return to {n:Kuroido-Moido} for your reward.

>**{c=red:Note}**:
* This quest cannot be completed if you are on {M:Windurst Mission 8-1|Windurst Mission 8-1|Vain}. If you are on the quest {q:Orastery Woes|Orastery Woes|Orastery Woes}, you may have to speak to {n:Kuroido-Moido} multiple times to complete the quest.
* It is recommended that you complete the quest {q:Rubbish Day|Rubbish Day|Rubbish Day} at the same time as this quest also sends you to the same Incinerator Room.

